    "Explain one-stage and chromogenic FVIII assays.",
    "Grade hemophilia severity from factor activity.",
    "Calculate and interpret Bethesda units with valid residual ranges.",
    "Recognise emicizumab interference and choose a bovine chromogenic assay."
  ],
